docs {
  - this request for create plan with CFS product” RingBackTone “
  - OM body has two product order items and the  new product order item has relationship type” migratedTo “ with  the old product order item
  - there is diferent in value of characteristics btween two product as below 
  - The product Characteristics for old product  order item 
                 "productCharacteristic":  { "name": "Tone", "value"                       : "Free Tone", }
  - The product Characteristics for new product  order item 
  "productCharacteristic":  { "name": "Tone", "value": "VIP", }
  
}
